{"id": "Dd9gsWCTDFE", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CODING\" to get this Free AI Coding Agent.\n\nYou can now vibe code with GPT-6, GLM 5.3 and DeepSeek 4.1 for completely free.\n\nIt's called Freebuff.\n\nIt's a free and open source coding agent, just like Claude Code.\n\nBut instead of paying $20 or $100 for a subscription.\n\nYou pay by watching a small ad in your terminal while it generates.\n\nEvery single day, you get around 5 hours of GPT-6 Luna.\n\nOr up to 20 hours of GLM 5.3.\n\nWith 8 other models to choose from.\n\nWhile these aren't the best models for coding.\n\nThey're still great for automating those long, repetitive tasks.\n\nThe kind that burn through your tokens every single day.\n\nThink of it like a free intern who handles the boring work while you focus on the hard parts.\n\nSave your paid credits for the work that actually needs a top model.\n\nLet Freebuff handle everything else in the background.\n\nThings like refactoring, writing tests, and cleaning up old code.\n\nThose tasks eat up tokens fast when you run them on a paid plan.\n\nHere you just sit through a short ad and then keep going.\n\nNo monthly bill ticking away in the background.\n\n#freebuff #aicoding #vibecoding #codingagent #gpt6", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1790877909, "like_count": 1955, "comment_count": 2022, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1101063066245991a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.825, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO7T3QKC674T54a4hfNCwIYLpvotu9Xc8iMkH9K3ypVF91eNROjfcTXfscz9j9XhBgvP6WYMyBcxWAeXuDLm0dBlZC8QgtdVTY0tp8.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdrqbgU2MJ-c5h31DRrBlxVe1tgpuzqUlQ47j4AWdXVcWLzoJr8_rANWgO_iX1DNXq0&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=EJi_iWeGgLk